# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ---- the on-device reader (26.94, D-03/D-12) ------------------------------
#
# The room's fourth tier is macOS Vision: free, on the machine, no provider,
# no prompt, no tokens. It is reached by running ONE program, tools/
# vision_read.swift, through the Apple toolchain — which makes the Command
# Line Tools a HARD prerequisite (#27 section 7 rejected shipping a
